<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 647 0 R
/E (Research has historically examined digital and AI literacy separately. As the forthcoming PISA 2029 assessment of Media and AI Literacy \(MAIL\) will do, this report brings them together, building on the foundations of decades of media and information literacy \(MIL\). Experience with digital literacy therefore shows what helps new literacy programmes succeed in schools and what makes them fail.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
