/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 657 0 R
/E (The latest edition of the EU reference, the Digital Competence Framework for Citizens \(DigComp 3.0\), integrates AI into all 21 of its competences, across five areas and four proficiency levels, treating AI literacy as part of digital competence rather than an add-on \(Cosgrove & Cachia, 2025\). Frameworks alone, however, do not guarantee implementation: the gap between policy standards and classroom practice persists \(Tinmaz et al., 2023\).)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
