<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 718 0 R
/E (Qatar follows a hybrid pedagogical model that combines standalone CIT instruction, cross-curricular integration, and a dedicated school e-project coordinator role, reinforced by robotics and AI competitions on the AI & Robotics Platform \(AI.MOE.QA\), the annual Digital Designer Competition, and School Digital Innovation Clubs. The country has committed to the PISA 2029 Media and AI Literacy \(MAIL\) assessment, and technical delivery is partly externalised to global partners; a five-year agreement signed with Scale AI in February 2025 \(Reuters, 2025\) supports AI-powered learning platforms and analytics across the government sector.)
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [6]
>>
