<<
/Title (These frameworks define what children and teachers should learn, though they largely describe proficiency levels rather than what to teach at which age. Curricula then translate them into sequenced learning experiences, and most systems fall short in this translation and in classroom teaching. This report therefore addresses a complementary question: under which conditions these competences can be taught equitably and sustainably in school systems. Answering it also requires credible ways to measure what students know and can do in AI-mediated environments, to which we now turn.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 8545 0 R
/Prev 8548 0 R
>>
